  "description": "Plan and analyse regulatory pathways for pharmaceuticals, medical devices, and healthcare products. Covers EMA and national agency procedures, clinical trial authorisation, marketing authorisation applications, and post-market surveillance requirements. Produces structured project plans with timelines, milestones, regulatory interactions, and submission strategies.",
